54,0.488,0.595,0.577,0.402,0.39,0.248,0.315,0.304,0.279,0.157],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"You hear the bosun before you see him. His deep voice echoes as he sings a sea shanty called 'Lowlands Low'. A monkey plays the accordion next to him, as the old man hollers like he needs to be heard by whales.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.224,"end":14.208,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":42,"words":42},"large":{"start":0.224,"end":14.208,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":42,"words":42},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"The song's a halyard shanty with a rhythm perfect for hauling the sails aloft. Most of a bosun's job is to supervise the crew on deck, and leading them in song is how Bosun Richards does it.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":14.496,"end":26.5,"frac":0.973,"status":"ok","matched":36,"words":37},"large":{"start":14.496,"end":26.592,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":37,"words":37},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"Quick! You look up the words for the shanty on your Pirate Captain App. If you want to impress Richards and get him as your Bosun, you need to show him that you can keep time. Sing or speak back the last two lines as passionately as you can when he gets to them!","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":27.04,"end":42.304,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":54,"words":54},"large":{"start":27.04,"end":42.304,"frac":0.981,"status":"ok","matched":53,"words":54},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"\"The monkey wears a soldier's clothes,","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":42.976,"end":45.3,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":6,"words":6},"large":{"start":42.976,"end":45.26,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":6,"words":6},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"Where he got 'em from, God only knows.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":45.3,"end":47.54,"frac":0.875,"status":"ok","matched":7,"words":8},"large":{"start":45.26,"end":47.34,"frac":0.625,"status":"ok","matched":5,"words":8},"differ":false},{"i":5,"text":"Our skipper comes from Barbados,","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":47.54,"end":49.88,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":5,"words":5},"large":{"start":47.34,"end":49.7,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":5,"words":5},"differ":false},{"i":6,"text":"He's got the name of Hammer Toes,","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":49.88,"end":52.06,"frac":0.857,"status":"ok","matched":6,"words":7},"large":{"start":49.7,"end":52.0,"frac":0.857,"status":"ok","matched":6,"words":7},"differ":false},{"i":7,"text":"GO!","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":1},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":1},"differ":false},{"i":8,"text":"He feeds us bread as hard as brass,","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":52.06,"end":54.42,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":8,"words":8},"large":{"start":52.0,"end":54.64,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":8,"words":8},"differ":false},{"i":9,"text":"Tastes salty as a sailor's –\"","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":54.42,"end":56.4455625,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":5,"words":5},"large":{"start":54.64,"end":56.4455625,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":5,"words":5},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/68f92ac1de934_PC%20JM6.png"}